# PURSUE visual-evidence — SHA-256 MANIFEST
# =========================================
# 14 image files + the official machine-readable catalogue, each preceded by
# its war.gov origin URL. Paths are relative to this pack's root.
#
# VERIFY (two equivalent ways, run from the pack root):
#   ./reproduce.sh                                        # full re-download + verify + re-derive
#   grep -vE '^#|^$' manifest.sha256 | shasum -a 256 -c -  # hash-check the bundled copies only
#
# Provenance note: these SHA-256 values were confirmed bit-for-bit identical to
# files served live from war.gov (three re-downloaded independently; a second
# operator reproduced the CSV modulo a byte-order mark). See README.md §Provenance.

